is transacylated to DAG by PNPLA2/3\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 1500596, \"displayName\": \"DAG [endoplasmic reticulum membrane]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DAG\", \"1,2-diacyl-sn-glycerol\", \"1,2-diacylglycerol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10956404], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-1500596\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-1500596.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 76116, \"displayName\": \"Glycerol [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"Glycerol\"], \"producedByEvent\": [10956404], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-76116\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-76116.2\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 10956448, \"displayName\": \"DAG is hydrolyzed to 2-MAG by PNPLA2/3\", \"followingEvent\": [10956404], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DAG is hydrolyzed to 2-MAG by PNPLA2/3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-1482811\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-1482811.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"CEL\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 68320, \"displayName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"name\": [\"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"C.elegans\", \"C. elegans\", \"Ce\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"6239\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Caenorhabditis elegans\", \"stId\": \"R-CEL-1482654\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-CEL-1482654.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions