        "@value": "5beta-cholesten-7alpha, 12alpha-diol-3-one [cytosol] + H+ [cytosol] + NADPH [cytosol] => 5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-triol [cytosol] + NADP+ [cytosol]"
