        "@value": "CoA-SH [peroxisomal matrix] + Phytanate [peroxisomal matrix] + ATP [peroxisomal matrix] => Phytanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + PPi [peroxisomal matrix] + AMP [peroxisomal matrix]"
