        "@value": "NAD+ [mitochondrial matrix] + (S)-3-Hydroxydodecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] => NADH [mitochondrial matrix] + 3-Oxododecanoyl-CoA [mitochondrial matrix] + H+ [mitochondrial matrix]"
